Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(nodes):=20add=20tool=5Fsheets=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Google=20Sheets=20service=20on=20the=20shared=20Workspace=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?client?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Google Sheets as a thin tool_google_workspace service layer (#1570 layout):
sheets/ carries only the 12 tool functions and response cleaners; the
credential/refresh/request machinery is the shared google_client. Protocol
tool_sheets:// / prefix / fields unchanged. Includes the agent example pipe.

Tests: 41 sheets unit tests (pass with and without the Google SDK installed).

Closes #1057

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
